<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Energy companies raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Energy companies raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Friday it had raised its ratings for Triton Energy Ltd and Rutherford-Moran Oil Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The firm also raised its rating for Pogo Producing Co to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))to</p>
</text>
